Weights licensing
=================

weights/tooth_detector_yolov8m_obb.pt
    Fine-tuned from Ultralytics YOLOv8m-OBB. Ultralytics releases YOLOv8 under
    AGPL-3.0 (https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/blob/main/LICENSE),
    and this derivative checkpoint is distributed under the same terms.
    If you need to use it in a closed-source product, obtain a commercial
    licence from Ultralytics or retrain from a permissively licensed detector.

