    Copyright (c) 2026 The HMA-Net authors. Released under the same MIT terms as
    the code, with the following restriction: research use only. The checkpoints
    must not be used for clinical diagnosis, treatment decisions, age assessment
    of minors, or any forensic or immigration procedure.
